{"text": "Long ago there lived a king. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Who was half barbaric. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> His ideas were large and wild. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And he had the power. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To turn them into facts. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When everything went. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> As he wished. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He was gentle and friendly. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But when something went wrong. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He was even more gentle and friendly. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> For nothing pleased him more. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Than making crooked things straight. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He built a huge public arena. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With seats all around it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But the arena was not for sports or fights. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Between men and wild animals. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was a place. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Where justice was decided. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> By chance alone. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When a man was accused. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Of a crime his fate was decided. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In this arena. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The king believed. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That this system. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Was perfectly fair.", "alignment": {"characters": ["L", "o", "n", "g", " ", "a", "g", "o", " ", "t", "h", "e", "r", "e", " ", "l", "i", "v", "e", "d", " ", "a", " ", "k", "i", "n", "g", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "W", "h", "o", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "h", "a", "l", "f", " ", "b", "a", "r", "b", "a", "r", "i", "c", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H", "i", "s", " ", "i", "d", "e", "a", "s", " ", "w", "e", "r", "e", " ", "l", "a", "r", "g", "e", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "w", "i", "l", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " "